  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>level-scan · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-scan-segmented-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-scan-segmented-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">const ELEMENT_COUNT: u32 = 1024u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">const BLOCK_COUNT: u32 = 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">const INPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const OUTPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"6\">const SUM_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const SEGMENT_FLAGS_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"8\">const SEGMENT_PREFIXES_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const SUMMARY_SEGMENT_FLAGS_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputValues: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"11\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; sumValues: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"13\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; segmentFlags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; segmentPrefixes: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"15\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; summarySegmentFlags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; scratch: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; segmentScratch: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"19\">@compute @workgroup_size(256) fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * 1u + workgroupId.y) * 4u + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= BLOCK_COUNT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  var inputValue = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  var inputSegmentFlag = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  if (index &lt; ELEMENT_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">    inputValue = inputValues[INPUT_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">    inputSegmentFlag = segmentFlags[SEGMENT_FLAGS_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  scratch[lane] = inputValue;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  segmentScratch[lane] = inputSegmentFlag;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  for (var stride = 1u; stride &lt; 256u; stride = stride * 2u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">    var addend = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    var addendSegment = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">    if (lane &gt;= stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">      addend = scratch[lane - stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">      addendSegment = segmentScratch[lane - stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    if (lane &gt;= stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">      scratch[lane] = select(addend + scratch[lane], scratch[lane], segmentScratch[lane] != 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">      segmentScratch[lane] = addendSegment | segmentScratch[lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  if (lane == 255u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    sumValues[SUM_OFFSET + workgroupIndex] = scratch[255u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    summarySegmentFlags[SUMMARY_SEGMENT_FLAGS_OFFSET + workgroupIndex] = segmentScratch[255u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  if (index &lt; ELEMENT_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    outputValues[OUTPUT_OFFSET + index] = scratch[lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    segmentPrefixes[SEGMENT_PREFIXES_OFFSET + index] = segmentScratch[lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>inputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall\">rainfall</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainTotals\">rainTotals</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>sumValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall-scan-level-0-block-sums\">rainfall-scan-level-0-block-sums</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>segmentFlags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"stateStarts\">stateStarts</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>segmentPrefixes<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall-scan-level-0-segment-prefixes\">rainfall-scan-level-0-segment-prefixes</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>summarySegmentFlags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall-scan-level-0-block-segment-flags\">rainfall-scan-level-0-block-segment-flags</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUScan/level-scan/portable · main · 122c2244</figcaption></figure></section>",
